OL,3,GNEWSADaughter of woman killed by
OL,4,Apartner 'refuses to be another victim'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA woman who was three years old when
OL,7,Fher mother was killed by her partner is
OL,8,Fspeaking out about the damage caused by
OL,9,Fdomestic abuse.
OL,11,FKeeley McKee only learned the full
OL,12,Fdetails of her mum Leanne's murder when
OL,13,Fshe turned 18.
OL,15,FShe is now channelling her pain into
OL,16,Fhighlighting domestic abuse and the
OL,17,Flasting impact it can have on those
OL,18,Fleft behind, determined to turn her own
OL,19,Fexperiences into something positive.
